    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d272">

                <pb facs="0364" n="352" sameAs="frus:frus1946v08/pg352"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894.011/11–446</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Assistant Secretary of State</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hilldring</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Chairman of the Far Eastern Commission</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >McCoy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-11-07">November 7, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>With reference to the consultative message of the Chairman of the Far Eastern
                    Commission to the Supreme Commander for the Allied Powers, dated October 29,
                        1946,<anchor n="39" xml:id="d272-f1"/> regarding the time and manner of
                    issuance of the Far Eastern Commission policy decision on the Provisions for the
                    Review of a New Japanese Constitution, there is enclosed a copy of a message
                    from the Supreme Commander for the Allied Powers dated November 1, 1946.</p>
                <p>It is requested that the Chairman make this message available to the members of
                    the Far Eastern Commission.</p>
                <closer><signed>J. H. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hilldring</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d272-a1.xml" xpointer="d272-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
